function RemiProfile() {
  return <div><Header dark /><main className="hannah-page remi-page"><section className="hannah-hero"><div className="hannah-hero-copy"><Link href="/leadership" className="profile-back"><ArrowLeft size={16} /><span>Back to Leadership</span></Link><Eyebrow>LEADERSHIP / 01</Eyebrow><h1>Remi<br /><em>Abubakar Bello.</em></h1><p>{remiProfile.title}<span>{remiProfile.organisation}</span></p><blockquote>“{remiProfile.quote}”</blockquote><div className="hannah-hero-actions"><Link href="/leadership" className="profile-text-link">Meet the leadership team <ArrowRight size={17} /></Link></div></div><div className="hannah-hero-image"><img src={remiProfile.image} alt="Remi Abubakar Bello, Senior Energy and Operations Advisor" /><span>R</span></div></section><section className="hannah-biography"><aside><Eyebrow>AT A GLANCE</Eyebrow><dl><div><dt>ROLE</dt><dd>{remiProfile.title}</dd></div><div><dt>FOCUS</dt><dd>Energy operations, technical leadership, and governance</dd></div><div><dt>EXPERIENCE</dt><dd>37+ years across technical and operational leadership</dd></div></dl></aside><div className="bio-copy"><Eyebrow>THE BIOGRAPHY</Eyebrow><h2>Technical depth.<br /><em>Practical judgement.</em></h2><p className="large-copy">{remiProfile.bio}</p><p>His technical foundation was built through progressive hands-on roles as an Assistant Driller, Safety Officer, and Mud Engineer with service companies before moving into drilling engineering and drilling-operations supervision at ExxonMobil. That breadth gives him a practical view of the relationship between operating discipline, safety, technical risk, and reliable delivery.</p><p>He holds a B.Eng. (Hons) in Chemical Engineering from Obafemi Awolowo University and is a member of the Nigeria Society of Engineers and the Society of Petroleum Engineers. He is also certified by the Council for the Regulation of Engineering in Nigeria (COREN).</p><p>Beyond the field, Remi has contributed to community and institutional governance. His experience includes advisory work for Legend Microfinance Bank Limited in Inisa, representing community-investor interests and supporting human-resources and strategic-planning discussions, followed by board-level service. He has also served on the governing board of Osun State University Integrated Ventures, supporting the development and management of viable business initiatives.</p><p>At Willers Solutions, Remi brings this combined technical and governance perspective to conversations where operational complexity, workforce judgement, and long-term organisational resilience need to work together.</p><div className="hannah-sector-list"><Eyebrow>EXPERIENCE AREAS</Eyebrow><div>{remiProfile.sectors.map((sector, index) => <span key={sector}><i>0{index + 1}</i>{sector}</span>)}</div></div></div></section><LeadershipClosing name="Remi Abubakar Bello" focus="Technical depth, operational discipline, and governance context." detail="Remi’s experience brings a steady, practical lens to the questions that sit between technical complexity, operating confidence, and long-term organisational resilience." /></main><Footer /></div>;
}
